 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Concession",
     "texto": [
      "**Wprawdzie..., jednak...** is equivalent to «it is true that..., but...». It is used to acknowledge one aspect before adding a reservation.",
      "**Nie do końca** softens a disagreement: «not entirely»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for clarification",
     "texto": [
      "**Co masz na myśli?** means «what do you mean?».",
      "**Uwzględnić** means to take something into account; **przyznać, że...** lets you acknowledge a fact without accepting the whole conclusion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
